=======
LEGEND
=======

0 = Background
# = Wall
G = Background and Goal
B = Background and Crate
* = Background and Goal and Crate
N = Background and HeadUp
S = Background and HeadDown
W = Background and HeadLeft
E = Background and HeadRight
u = Background and BodyUp
d = Background and BodyDown
l = Background and BodyLeft
r = Background and BodyRight
U = Background and TailUp
T = Background and TailDown
L = Background and TailLeft
R = Background and TailRight

Snake = HeadUp or HeadDown or HeadLeft or HeadRight or BodyUp or BodyDown or BodyLeft or BodyRight or TailUp or TailDown or TailLeft or TailRight
Head = HeadUp or HeadDown or HeadLeft or HeadRight
Player = Head
Body = BodyUp or BodyDown or BodyLeft or BodyRight
Tail = TailUp or TailDown or TailLeft or TailRight
Solid = Wall or Crate or Snake
Move = MoveUp or MoveDown or MoveLeft or MoveRight

================
COLLISIONLAYERS
================

Background
Goal
Wall, Crate, HeadUp, HeadDown, HeadLeft, HeadRight, BodyUp, BodyDown, BodyLeft, BodyRight, TailUp, TailDown, TailLeft, TailRight
MoveUp, MoveDown, MoveLeft, MoveRight

=====
RULES
=====

up    [ Head | Crate | no Solid ] -> [ BodyUp | MoveUp up Crate | no Solid ]
down  [ Head | Crate | no Solid ] -> [ BodyDown | MoveDown down Crate | no Solid ]
left  [ Head | Crate | no Solid ] -> [ BodyLeft | MoveLeft left Crate | no Solid ]
right [ Head | Crate | no Solid ] -> [ BodyRight | MoveRight right Crate | no Solid ]

up    [ Head | no Solid ] -> [ BodyUp | MoveUp ]
down  [ Head | no Solid ] -> [ BodyDown | MoveDown ]
left  [ Head | no Solid ] -> [ BodyLeft | MoveLeft ]
right [ Head | no Solid ] -> [ BodyRight | MoveRight ]

late [ MoveUp ] -> [ HeadUp ]
late [ MoveDown ] -> [ HeadDown ]
late [ MoveLeft ] -> [ HeadLeft ]
late [ MoveRight ] -> [ HeadRight ]

late up    [ Tail | BodyUp ] -> [ | TailUp ]
late down  [ Tail | BodyUp ] -> [ | TailUp ]
late left  [ Tail | BodyUp ] -> [ | TailUp ]
late right [ Tail | BodyUp ] -> [ | TailUp ]

late up    [ Tail | BodyDown ] -> [ | TailDown ]
late down  [ Tail | BodyDown ] -> [ | TailDown ]
late left  [ Tail | BodyDown ] -> [ | TailDown ]
late right [ Tail | BodyDown ] -> [ | TailDown ]

late up    [ Tail | BodyLeft ] -> [ | TailLeft ]
late down  [ Tail | BodyLeft ] -> [ | TailLeft ]
late left  [ Tail | BodyLeft ] -> [ | TailLeft ]
late right [ Tail | BodyLeft ] -> [ | TailLeft ]

late up    [ Tail | BodyRight ] -> [ | TailRight ]
late down  [ Tail | BodyRight ] -> [ | TailRight ]
late left  [ Tail | BodyRight ] -> [ | TailRight ]
late right [ Tail | BodyRight ] -> [ | TailRight ]

==============
WINCONDITIONS
==============

All Goal on Crate

